== WHY SITs ARE DROPPED (rejected for ANY of these reasons) ==
  (a) no pattern section     : no usable Pattern prose
  (b) no proximity spec      : no patternsProximity / 'within N characters'
  (c) no keyword list        : no positive keyword bullet
  (d) ML/named-entity        : trainable / named-entity / exact-data-match
  (e) non-English keyword(s) : at least one non-ASCII keyword
  (f) Func_* classifier      : Pattern names a Func_* fn, no literal format
  (g) verified non-matching  : hardcoded remove list; regex matches no real
                               sample (see docs/reg_pat_samples.log)

== HARDCODED REMOVE LIST (verified non-matching; criterion g) ==
These SITs are force-excluded regardless of criteria (a)-(f); see docs/reg_pat_samples.log.
